WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.662
Hi! I'm Sarah. Let's talk about some important dates!

2
00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:10.502
New Year's Day is on January first.

3
00:00:10.952 --> 00:00:13.553
It's the first day of the year!

4
00:00:15.803 --> 00:00:18.357
And this is my birthday cake!

5
00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:22.151
My birthday is on March twenty-second.

6
00:00:24.401 --> 00:00:26.815
I was born in nineteen ninety-eight.

7
00:00:29.065 --> 00:00:34.685
In the United States, people say the month first: July fourth.

8
00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:39.686
But for this holiday, they say: the Fourth of July!

9
00:00:41.936 --> 00:00:45.512
Christmas Day is on December twenty-fifth.

10
00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:51.209
In Britain, people say the day first: the twenty-fifth of December.

11
00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:58.939
And my English classes start on February ninth, twenty twenty-six.

12
00:00:59.389 --> 00:01:01.758
And you? When is your birthday?

